color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.00<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20081017092717&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ore_Wagon_27caff.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an ore wagon.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Around and inside <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Mines\">Formorgar Mines</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Beregar\">Beregar</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine%20Mines\">Farmine Mines</a>, parts of <a href=\"#/wiki/Factory%20Quarter\">Factory Quarter</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Used to transport people, coal and other cargo. Only the ones in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Beregar\">Beregar</a> can actually be used, though; tickets to travel around in Kazordoon can be bought from Ore Wagon System Ticket Seller NPCs. The ones in Beregar are part of a quest and can be used for free.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/a-fathers-burden-quest\">A Father's Burden Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Astral%20Bridge\">Astral Bridge</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blessings\">Blessings</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boat\">Boat</a></li><li>Buffer Stop</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dog%20Sled\">Dog Sled</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dukosch\">Dukosch</a></li><li>Fields</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Crystal%20Teleport%20System\">Gnomish Crystal Teleport System</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a></li><li>Kazordoon Entrance</li><li>Lost Cavern</li><li>Lower Barracks</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lucius\">Lucius</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lukosch\">Lukosch</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Carpet\">Magic Carpet</a></li><li>Navigation</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nordic%20Tibia%20Ferries\">Nordic Tibia Ferries</a></li><li>Port Hope Ferries</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Protection%20Zone\">Protection Zone</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pukosch\">Pukosch</a></li><li>Rails</li><li>Rollercoaster</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Route%3AKazordoon%20Steamship\">Route:Kazordoon Steamship</a></li><li>Shops Street</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">Steamship</a></li><li>Streets of Kazordoon</li><li>Streets of Kazordoon+1</li><li>Streets of Kazordoon+2</li><li>Streets of Kazordoon+3</li><li>Streets of Kazordoon+4</li><li>Streets of Kazordoon+5</li><li>Streets of Kazordoon-1</li><li>Streets of Kazordoon-2</li><li>Streets of Kazordoon-3</li><li>Streets of Kazordoon-4</li><li>Streets of K